00:33:35.940 --> 00:33:38.130
offered to do a
dollar-for-dollar match

00:33:38.130 --> 00:33:41.850
on all funds raised for research
through the premium channel.

00:33:41.850 --> 00:33:43.382
This is a terrific
way that they're

00:33:43.382 --> 00:33:45.840
going to amplify whatever funds
come in through the premium

00:33:45.840 --> 00:33:48.348
channel, to further support
research for science

00:33:48.348 --> 00:33:50.890
and science-related tools for
mental health, physical health,

00:33:50.890 --> 00:33:51.700
and performance.

00:33:51.700 --> 00:33:54.310
If you'd like to sign up for the
Huberman Lab Premium channel,

00:33:54.310 --> 00:33:56.440
again, there's a cost
of $10 per month.

00:33:56.440 --> 00:33:59.110
