front for the entire year.

00:33:59.110 --> 00:34:01.410
That will give you
access to all the AMAs.

00:34:01.410 --> 00:34:04.680
You can ask questions and get
answers to your questions.

00:34:04.680 --> 00:34:06.930
You'll of course get
answers to all the questions

00:34:06.930 --> 00:34:08.320
