episodes not found elsewhere.

00:34:17.489 --> 00:34:19.440
Again, you'll be
supporting research

00:34:19.440 --> 00:34:21.639
for mental health, physical
health, and performance.

00:34:21.639 --> 00:34:23.639
You can sign up for the
premium channel by going

00:34:23.639 --> 00:34:25.980
